OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after girl, 16, dies
OL,4,Afollowing 'hit-and-run'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 16-year-old girl has died after being
OL,7,Ffatally injured in what police believe
OL,8,Fwas a hit-and-run.
OL,10,FThe teenager was found seriously
OL,11,Finjured near a bus stop on Rook's Nest
OL,12,FRoad in Wakefield at about 20:30 BST on
OL,13,FTuesday and was taken to hospital. She
OL,14,Fdied on Saturday, officers confirmed.
OL,16,FWest Yorkshire Police said a
OL,17,F25-year-old man was arrested on
OL,18,Fsuspicion of causing death by dangerous
OL,19,Fdriving in the early hours and remained
OL,20,Fin custody.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
